    "id": "1700000000000000102",
    "url": "https://x.com/testsubject/status/1700000000000000102",
    "text": "First: we stopped asking algorithm puzzles. Nobody on our team has written a red-black tree in six years. We now ship a scoped, paid two-day project drawn from a real ticket we already closed.",
